      "name": "Section Intro Text",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Rooted in Africa.",
        "descriptions": "<p>Across the continent, over 700 million hectares of degraded land hold immense potential for regenerative agriculture and nature-based carbon removal. In many regions, agriculture is the backbone of daily life: a source of food, income, and stability. When soil breaks down, so does that foundation. Oath Africa exists to restore it. We partner with farmers, local institutions, and companies to improve soil health, increase yields, and generate high-integrity carbon credits. Our early projects span thousands of hectares, and our model is designed to grow—country by country, continent-wide.<br/><br/></p><p><em>Heathy soil aligns transformative global impact with meaningful local benefits. <br/></em></p>",
        "button_text": "Learn more",
        "button_url": "",
        "padding_top": 150,
        "padding_bottom": 150,
        "padding_top_mobile": 100,
        "padding_bottom_mobile": 100
