      "settings": {
        "heading": "Backed by science. Built for regeneration.",
        "descriptions": "<p>Oath Africa is a public benefit company that works hand-in-hand with farmers and land stewards to apply Oath Soil Life across diverse landscapes — through approaches that are scientifically rigorous, economically viable, and community-centered.<br/><br/>Unlike conventional products, Oath Soil Life  reintroduces beneficial microbes into depleted soils, unlocking productivity and resilience from within—boosting root growth, crop health, and soil function. </p>",
